  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).\n• In a medium bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add it to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-b5483500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice cucumber into thin half-moons.\n• Slice lemon into wedges. Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using). Roughly chop coriander. Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Cut paneer into 3cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-07b8dd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second medium bowl, combine basic sponge mix (see ingredients), Mumbai spice blend and the salt. Gradually add the water (for the batter) to make a batter (it should be thick but pourable).\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, dip paneer into batter to coat and immediately transfer to pan.\n• Cook pakora in batches until golden, 2-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate and season with a pinch of salt.\n• TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the pakora does not stick to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-ee1f1f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Crush long chilli (if using), garlic, half the coriander and a pinch of salt with a pestle and mortar until it resembles a fine paste.\n• Transfer to a small bowl, then add Greek-style yoghurt, a generous squeeze of lemon juice and a splash of water. Stir until well combined.\n• TIP: Some like it hot, but if you don’t just hold back on the chilli.\n• TIP: If you don’t have a pestle and mortar, finely chop ingredients to form a chunky, rustic sauce!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-028a7130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled onion.\n• In a large bowl, combine gourmet leaf mix, pickled onion, cucumber, tomatoes and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-afcd6840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cherry tomato salad between plates.\n• Top with crispy paneer pakora.\n• Drizzle over green chutney and tamarind chutney.\n• Garnish with remaining coriander and serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-9350a350.jpg"
    }
  ]
